===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|kiwifruit}}

===Etymology===
Trade name used by exporters for one of several varieties selectively bred in New Zealand; named after the endemic New Zealand bird, the  {{m|en|kiwi}}, because the fruit's fuzzy brown skin resembles the plumage of the bird. From {{der|en|mi|kiwi||kiwi bird}}.

